{
    "title": "Jeel: Kids Early Education",
    "description": "What does the Jeel app offer to young children?\r\nSeries, stories and songs with and without music, games and other fun educational educational videos and the following practical activities after each episode your child watches.\r\n\r\n  A generation application that aims to help you build a new world and a unique generation for your child from the age of three to nine years.\r\n\r\n  What does the Jeel app offer to adult users who are parents?\r\n\r\nJeel offers a continuous journey that you share with your child, as it allows you to:\r\n\u2713 Using a useful screen time feature that improves his behavior.\r\n\u2713 A section for parents \u201cJusour\u201d that provides you with rich content of educational articles and developmental programs related to the topics of the episodes your child watches, in order to help you in performing your educational role optimally.\r\n\u2713 Detailed reports showing your child's performance level, strengths, tendencies, interaction and hours of use.\r\n\u2713 The opportunity to communicate with educational teachers in a unique interactive educational experience like never before.\r\n\r\n  Jeel application features:\r\n\u2713 Designed according to a value and educational system prepared by a number of educational experts.\r\n\u2713 It provides integrated entertainment content in two versions, with music and without music, that combines cartoon series, the animal world, stories, songs and games.\r\n\u2713 Designed according to an integrated vision that suits the child's interests, psyche, and sensory and mental abilities.\r\n\u2713 Provides parents with reports showing the child's interaction with the application through three axes:\r\n\u2713 Activity Reports: Parents know how much their child has benefited from the app and the results of their activities at the end of each episode so they can make better use of the content provided to parents\r\n\u2713 Usage reports: know when and for how long a child uses the app and provide actionable recommendations if the child spends more time than allowed, or uses the app at bedtime\r\n\u2713 Viewing Reports: Provides parents with a detailed view of their child's interests, favorite content and number of views for each episode\r\n\u2713 It provides parents with an integrated educational section that helps them play their role with their children through:\r\n\u2713 Educational papers: an educational explanation of the value of each episode, and its direct and indirect impact on the child's behavior.\r\n  \u2713 Developmental Programs: A detailed educational explanation, by steps, of how to develop the child's behavior in this value.\r\n\u2713 Enables parents to set the child's daily usage time.\r\n\u2713 The application provides the user with the advantage of choosing the entire content with music and without music.\r\n\u2713 Each child's account is monitored completely independently.\r\n\u2713 The highest levels of security that preserve the user's privacy and protect his information.\r\n\u2713 Payment is made via the parent app only.\r\n\r\nJeel application content:\r\n  Series featuring Happy Forest, Dido's World, Small World and other useful and interesting events for your child.\r\nDiscover with us, including fun videos that include a world of knowledge and exciting information for your child.\r\nGeneration songs that your child loves to sing and love in all that is beautiful.\r\nTales that instill in your child educational and moral values in a fun and entertaining way.\r\nA group of interactive games for children such as intelligence games, memory games, coloring and puzzle games.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us via e-mail. hello@jeelapp.com\r\nDownload the Jeel application so that your child can enjoy and participate in their educational journey.\r\nA generation application \u2026 a new generation and a unique world.\r\n\r\n[Minimum supported app version: 3.7.7]",
