child uses the app and provide actionable recommendations if the child spends more time than allowed, or uses the app at bedtime<br>\u2713 Viewing Reports: Provides parents with a detailed view of their child&#39;s interests, favorite content and number of views for each episode<br>\u2713 It provides parents with an integrated educational section that helps them play their role with their children through:<br>\u2713 Educational papers: an educational explanation of the value of each episode, and its direct and indirect impact on the child&#39;s behavior.<br>  \u2713 Developmental Programs: A detailed educational explanation, by steps, of how to develop the child&#39;s behavior in this value.<br>\u2713 Enables parents to set the child&#39;s daily usage time.<br>\u2713 The application provides the user with the advantage of choosing the entire content with music and without music.<br>\u2713 Each child&#39;s account is monitored completely independently.<br>\u2713 The highest levels of security that preserve the user&#39;s privacy and protect his information.<br>\u2713 Payment is made via the parent app only.<br><br>Jeel application content:<br>  Series featuring Happy Forest, Dido&#39;s World, Small World and other useful and interesting events for your child.<br>Discover with us, including fun videos that include a world of knowledge and exciting information for your child.<br>Generation songs that your child loves to sing and love in all that is beautiful.<br>Tales that instill in your child educational and moral values in a fun and entertaining way.<br>A group of interactive games for children such as intelligence games, memory games, coloring and puzzle games.<br><br>If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us via e-mail. hello@jeelapp.com<br>Download the Jeel application so that your child can enjoy and participate in their educational journey.<br>A generation application \u2026 a new generation and a unique world.<br><br>[Minimum supported app version: 3.7.7]",
